      654        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      655        SIZE 39.25 BY 9.33.
      656   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-7
      657        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      658        SIZE 28.63 BY 4.38.
      659   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-8
      660        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      661        SIZE 28.63 BY 2.08.
      662   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-9
      663        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      664        SIZE 28.63 BY 4.38.
